  "decision_summary": "The query is a lipophilic, neutral, heteroaromatic piperidine acrylamide (ibrutinib-like pyrazolopyrimidine). Direct monkey Fpod of 10% for compound 4p (C18), if applicable, is below the 20% threshold. Transferable low-F contexts (C01/C05, C12, C08) and additional low-F animal records (C22, C26) affirmatively support F < 20%. L5 close-analog no-efflux/high-permeability records (C55, C61) support absorption but are not threshold-relevant and do not address first-pass metabolism; they do not change the decision. Prediction: low."
